										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<h3>Product features</h3>
<ul>
<li>Multiple processes such as filtration, washing, and drying can be completed within the equipment.</li>
<li>Continuous operation throughout the entire process, suitable for sterile and non sterile pharmaceutical, chemical and other industries.</li>
<li>Suitable for working conditions with high solid content, where solid and liquid phases need to be recycled separately.</li>
<li>Unique structural design can significantly increase the filtration area, improve filtration and drying efficiency.</li>
<li>The lower part of the cone is the discharge port, making it convenient for complete discharge.</li>
<li>Filter elements can be installed on the cylinder, cone, and tank bottom, ensuring complete filtration without residue.</li>
<li>The equipment can be equipped with heat exchange devices in all directions, including hollow shafts and double screw belt mixers.</li>
<li>Double spiral belt three-dimensional stirring device, with outstanding stirring effect, ensures that the material is in a thin layer filter cake state during the filtration process.</li>
</ul>
